Speaking alongside Spanish Prime Minister Pedro Sanchez on Wednesday, French President Emmanuel Macron said that it would be "a good decision" if the UK decided to rejoin the European Union. The two leaders met at the Moncloa Palace in Madrid on the second day of Macron's two-day state visit to Spain.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f943f80e-bcc5-11f1-9e59-d367a0468893/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-30T115111Z-1926653752-RC2NTNAIQ2O3-RTRMADP-3-SPAIN-FRANCE-POLITICS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f943f80e-bcc5-11f1-9e59-d367a0468893/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-30T115111Z-1926653752-RC2NTNAIQ2O3-RTRMADP-3-SPAIN-FRANCE-POLITICS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">9151824c-bcc1-11f1-8b6b-c97e1a67d201</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:49:56 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/f943f80e-bcc5-11f1-9e59-d367a0468893/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-30T115111Z-1926653752-RC2NTNAIQ2O3-RTRMADP-3-SPAIN-FRANCE-POLITICS.jpg">© Juan Medina, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Forced landing of Israel-bound flight: What we know so far</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-forced-landing-of-israel-bound-flight-what-we-know-so-far</link><description>
The Israeli government believes an incident on a flight from the United Arab Emirates to Israel, which diverted to Saudi Arabia after transmitting emergency signals on Wednesday, may have been an attempted "terror attack" by one of the pilots. France 24’s Shirli Sitbon takes a look at what we know about the incident so far, with many of the details still emerging.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7c476fec-bcc1-11f1-8b3b-ddce071186a9/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260930-130114-130743-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7c476fec-bcc1-11f1-8b3b-ddce071186a9/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260930-130114-130743-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">81540de2-bcc1-11f1-809f-bf8861a6c7c2</guid><pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:29:51 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Mixed reactions in Iraq on final day of US-led coalition withdrawal</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260930-mixed-reactions-in-iraq-on-final-day-of-us-led-coalition-withdrawal</link><description>
